HDR e5 "gap" is a distance-calibration OVERSHOOT, not a coding deficit (#74/#11, 2026-07-15)
commit: child of 2757e856
host: lilith  date: 2026-07-15
corpus: /mnt/v/input/jxl-encoder/hdr-crops-512/*.hdr.png (88 PQ crops, 512x512, transfer=16)
ours: target/release/cjxl-rs (default features, WITH the buttloop-skip fix 6236d5fd)
